#. tree:labels#/instruction
#: scripts/build-gaokao-downloads.mjs:16
msgctxt "tree:labels#/instruction"
msgid ""
"All items are single-choice. Source boxes are part of the question. Unless "
"stated otherwise, lunar phase, time, route, and version come only from the "
"source box, not the site's live state. Record answers separately and confirm "
"track, difficulty, and page order."
msgstr "全問単一選択。資料枠も問題の一部。別記がない限り月相・時刻・経路・版は資料枠に従い、サイトの現在状態は参照しない。解答は別紙へ記入し、印刷前に区分・難度・頁を確認すること。"

